# REVOICE lane runtime artifacts. Job inputs keep a FULL COPY of each source
# clip and outputs are whole mp4s, so these grow fast (505MB after a handful of
# smoke runs) and must never be committed. NOTE the Lens lane predates this and
# HAS its job sidecars + output PNGs tracked in git — do not copy that pattern.
/data/revoice-jobs/
/public/outputs/revoice/
